{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:15:31Z","content":"The **Offline Password Manager** web application has been created in `C:\\Users\\vijay\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\offline-password-manager`.\n\n### Architecture & Security Highlights\n\n- **100% Offline & Zero Network Calls**: Enforced with a strict Content Security Policy (`connect-src 'none'`). All styling, icons, and fonts are self-contained locally.\n- **Client-Side Cryptography**:\n  - **Key Derivation**: PBKDF2 with SHA-256 and 100,000 iterations using a cryptographically secure 16-byte random salt ([`crypto.js`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/services/crypto.js)).\n  - **Encryption**: AES-GCM 256-bit authenticated encryption with a unique 12-byte IV per record.\n  - **Zero-Knowledge Auth**: Master password validity is verified against a canary token (`__OFFLINE_VAULT_CANARY_OK__`). No password hash is ever saved.\n  - **Volatile Memory**: The encryption key is held only in RAM and is purged immediately upon manual locking or inactivity timeout.\n- **Browser Persistence**: Data is saved exclusively on your device in browser IndexedDB ([`db.js`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/services/db.js)) as encrypted ciphertexts.\n- **Vault Features**:\n  - Categories: Logins, Payment Cards, Secure Notes, and Favorites ([`Sidebar.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/components/Sidebar.jsx)).\n  - Built-in Password Generator with entropy calculation ([`PasswordGeneratorModal.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/components/PasswordGeneratorModal.jsx)).\n  - Vault Health Audit highlighting weak and reused passwords ([`SecurityAuditModal.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/components/SecurityAuditModal.jsx)).\n  - AES-GCM Encrypted JSON Backup Export and Import ([`SettingsModal.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/src/components/SettingsModal.jsx)).\n  - Configurable Auto-Lock timer (1, 5, 10, 15, 30, or 60 minutes).\n\n---\n\n### How to Run\n\n#### Option 1: Instant Standalone (No Node/npm setup needed)\nDouble-click [`offline-vault.html`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/offline-vault.html) or open it in any browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Brave). It runs immediately with full offline React, Web Crypto, and IndexedDB capabilities.\n\n#### Option 2: Vite React Development Server\nIf you prefer developing with Vite:\n```bash\ncd C:\\Users\\vijay\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\offline-password-manager\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nFor full details on the project structure and testing instructions, see the [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0fddf4ef-d93f-406e-8ec9-d51e8406f759/walkthrough.md) and [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-password-manager/README.md)."}
