{"step_index":99,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:52:08Z","thinking":"**Designing the In-Page Helper**\n\nPlanning the `content.js` script for injection across all web pages. The script should locate specific input fields. Identifying password input fields using the `input[type=\"password\"]` selector. Identifying username fields using a more comprehensive set of selectors, including various `type`, `autocomplete`, `name`, and `id` attributes that commonly designate username input fields. The next step involves implementing behav